OL,3,GNEWSAParamedic helps deliver baby by
OL,4,Aphone after course
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paramedic who learned life-saving
OL,7,Fnewborn delivery skills on a pioneering
OL,8,Ftraining course helped successfully
OL,9,Fdeliver a baby over the phone later
OL,10,Fthat day.
OL,12,FOllie Zorab guided another paramedic
OL,13,Fthrough an out-of-hospital delivery
OL,14,Fhours after he had completed the
OL,15,Ftraining at the Great Western Hospital
OL,16,F(GWH) in Swindon, Wiltshire.
OL,18,FZorab said the most important thing he
OL,19,Ftook away from the out-of-hospital
OL,20,Fdelivery course was to "try and keep a
OL,21,Fnewborn baby warm" moments after birth.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
