OL,3,GNEWSAParamedic helps deliver baby by
OL,4,Aphone after course
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe training - which has been rolled
OL,7,Fout nationally - was designed by GWH
OL,8,Fneonatal consultant Sarah Bates who
OL,9,Fsaid it was to help babies who
OL,10,F"unexpectedly need resuscitation" or
OL,11,Fwere not planned to be born at home.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
